lede="GTA Online on PC was famous for cheaters for almost a decade before Rockstar acted. In September 2024 the studio finally added BattlEye anti-cheat to the PC version. With GTA 6 on PC still unannounced, the obvious question is whether its online mode will ship with the same protection from day one.",
